            <ArticleTitle>[Analysis of projects funded by NSFC in field of Chinese material medica resource in recent three years].</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>3696-3701</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.4268/cjcmm20161932</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>The paper reviewed the sponsorship and final reports of projects focus on Science of Chinese materia medica resource in Medical Science Department, National Natural Science Foundation of China. The applicant and supportive organizations were analyzed. The progress and results of some projects were summarized by research fields including formation mechanism of Dao-di herbs, research of plant taxonomy, breeding and cultivation of medical plants, ecological and environmental adaptability of Chinese materia medica resource, quality assessment of Chinese materia medica resource, and biosynthesis and regulation of active compounds. In addition, the potential problems and the most and least focused areas in the application were summarized for reference.</AbstractText>
